{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳一段車Cam片段，顯示在黃大仙中心北館停車場外，一輛客貨 Van懷疑在雙白線及黃格線位置調頭，期間車輛一度疑似「跣胎」，差點撞到一名拉着垃圾桶過馬路的清潔女工。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-17h05m49s925.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026QzngkPn84H1785835135.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-17h05m49s925.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">幸客貨 Van 及時修正方向，未有釀成交通意外。事發時，該名清潔女工面對突發狀況依然保持淡定，事件隨即引起網民熱議。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-17h05m52s281.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TAZUB0CRD91785835135.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-17h05m52s281.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">對於涉事客貨 Van 的違規行為，有網民直言：「擺明係雙白線掉頭」、「揸車揸到跳舞咁！」亦有網民留言嘲諷：「飄移得好靚喎」、「唔講仲以為拍戲」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T09:39:08.197385+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}